## Audit & Monitoring

### Audit Logging
**Logged Actions:**
- LOGIN / LOGOUT
- CREATE / READ / UPDATE / DELETE
- DOWNLOAD / UPLOAD / EXPORT / IMPORT
- PUBLISH / APPROVE / REJECT
- RESET_PASSWORD / CHANGE_PASSWORD
