    "planName": "Professional",
    "status": "Active",
    "startDate": "2024-06-09",
    "endDate": "2024-07-09"
  }
}
```

---

### 2. Update Subscription
**Endpoint:** `PUT /SuperAdmin/Subscription/:subscriptionId`

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "planName": "Enterprise",
